"title":"I Samuel 7:6","segments":["And they gathered together to Mizpeh, and drew water, and poured [it] out before the LORD, and fasted on that day, and said there, We have sinned against the LORD. And Samuel judged the children of Israel in Mizpeh."],"ref":"I Samuel 7:6","verse":6,"words":[{"text":"And they gathered together","strong":"H6908"},{"text":" to Mizpeh","strong":"H4709"},{"text":", and drew","strong":"H7579"},{"text":" water","strong":"H4325"},{"text":", and poured [it] out","strong":"H8210"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", and fasted","strong":"H6684"},{"text":" on that day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":", and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" there, We have sinned","strong":"H2398"},{"text":" against the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":". And Samuel","strong":"H8050"},{"text":" judged","strong":"H8199"},{"text":" the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" in Mizpeh","strong":"H4708"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":7359,"title":"I Samuel 7:7","segments":["¶And when the Philistines heard that the children of Israel were gathered together to Mizpeh, the lords of the Philistines went up against Israel. And when the children of Israel heard [it], they were afraid of the Philistines."],"ref":"I Samuel 7:7","verse":7,"words":[{"text":"¶And when the Philistines","strong":"H6430"},{"text":" heard","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" that the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" were gathered together","strong":"H6908"},{"text":" to Mizpeh","strong":"H4708"},{"text":", the lords","strong":"H5633"},{"text":" of the Philistines","strong":"H6430"},{"text":" went up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" against Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":". And when the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" heard","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" [it], they were afraid","strong":"H3372"},{"text":" of","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" the Philistin